\begin_inset Formula $r$
\end_inset
 close to 1, gives 160 to 180 g at mid-stroke and 200 to 225 g at the lift-off on the draw. The aim of 80 to 100 g is out of reach with this hole and this peak, whatever the mechanism.
\end_layout

